<section class="section-21"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer main-container w-container"><div class="title-upper-text">																		A traditional Korean wrapping cloth														</div><h1 class="heading-12">Bojagi Wrapping  <span class="text-span-3"><strong class="bold-text-7"> 보자기</strong>	</span></h1></div></section><section class="section-22"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer main-container w-container"><img src="{{ 'bojagi-from-gmail.jpg' | asset_url }}" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 728px, 940px" alt=""/><div class="columns-7 w-row"><div class="column-47 w-col w-col-6"><p class="paragraph-8"><strong class="bold-text-5">한국에서는 감사함을 담은 선물을 소중히 한번 더 감쌉니다. 이때 사용하는 윤기 넘치는 천을 ‘보자기’라고 부릅니다. 선물을 받는 사람에 대한 애정과 존경이 오롯이 전달되길 바라는 마음이담겨있습니다. THE HYUN의 Artistry가 담긴 보자기에 당신의 진심을 담아 전달해보세요 </strong></p></div><div class="column-48 w-col w-col-6"><p class="body-copy left-align">Unveil the elegance of Bojagi with our exclusive gift sets. Beyond mere wrapping, this lively, eco-friendly fabric is a living tradition, symbolizing respect and genuine care in Korean gift customs. Each piece is a crafted marvel, a tiny universe of sustainable cultural expression around your gifts. Wrapped in centuries of tradition, Bojagi transports everything from treats to treasures, infusing your gifts with heritage and thoughtfulness. Immerse yourself in the blend of style and utility, while embracing the Korean flair, with our artfully Bojagi-wrapped gift sets - a lively celebration of culture, a testament to sincere care, and an appreciation of unwrapping joy.</p></div></div></div></section>
